{"about_the_game":"The world's greatest indoor game goes to outer-space!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the year 2629, three years after the evil Chuslibs' defeat on New Earth, Lieutenant Jerry J. Jensen is taking his girlfriend Cisco to play pool at the ritzy Asta-Pool Club, a billiards joint near his star-base.  Little does Jerry know about the explosive asta-night that awaits him as he battles to prove whether humans can still beat bots in the 27th Century.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn space, pool is played on large, steel tables outside your window where balls float effortlessly.  Many new, exciting games have been invented since the humble, green-felt tables of centuries past, but both the old and new games are cherished by asta-noobs and hustlers alike!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAsta-Pool is:<br />\r\n* Perfect for humans who have never played pool before! (You are shown how to play.)<br />\r\n* Over 25 different games and 40 levels of fun, humor, and extras.<br />\r\n* Completely family-friendly.<br />\r\n* Different than any pool game you have ever experienced!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can: <br />\r\n* Play relaxing turn-based classics like 8-ball and 9-ball.<br />\r\n* Play fast-paced games like Scramble and Asta-Ball.<br />\r\n* Play other NEW games invented long after you die!<br />\r\n* Learn basic pool terms and techniques.<br />\r\n* Learn fancy moves like bank-shots, kick-shots, and combinations!<br />\r\n* Discover The Asta-Pool Club's sinister secret.<br />\r\n* Take &quot;The Sharkbot Challenge.&quot;<br />\r\n* Become a better pool-player!<br />\r\n* Play the person sitting next to you (with additional pc-compatible controller).","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"8-Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2730220/bd6093596b04215f4a5937d60d6f10addfb6a6a1.jpg"},{"name":"Anti-Freeze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2730220/513b1c2aea3b5df60f0bd58455f95fecd42d50d6.jpg"},{"name":"As